{
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "editable": true,
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Lire les logs",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Choisissez un **conteneur**, un **flux** et la période en haut. Le champ **Texte** cherche une expression littérale (vide = tous les messages).\n\nLes erreurs possibles sont repérées par mots clés ; **stderr ne signifie pas toujours erreur**. Une absence de logs ne prouve pas un arrêt. Les actions WebMon restent visibles indépendamment des filtres."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Volume des messages filtrés par conteneur / minute",
      "description": "Fenêtre glissante de 1 minute. Suit les filtres Conteneur, Flux et Texte.",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 7
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (container) (count_over_time({container=~`${container:regex}`, container=~\".+\", stream=~`${stream:regex}`} |= ${search:json} [1m]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "legendFormat": "{{container}}",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Messages récents — sélection",
      "description": "500 lignes maximum, les plus récentes en premier. Cliquer une ligne pour ses détails. Les filtres du haut s’appliquent.",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=~`${container:regex}`, container=~\".+\", stream=~`${stream:regex}`} |= ${search:json}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Erreurs possibles — sélection",
      "description": "Mots clés error, fatal, panic, exception, failed, failure, échec. Peut inclure des faux positifs ; consulter les messages récents pour le contexte.",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=~`${container:regex}`, container=~\".+\", stream=~`${stream:regex}`} |= ${search:json} |~ `(?i)(\\b(error|fatal|panic|exception|failed|failure)\\b|échec|echec)`",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Actions de récupération WebMon",
      "description": "Redémarrages, reconstructions, retours à l’état sain et refus. Ce panneau suit la période mais ignore les filtres Conteneur, Flux et Texte.",
      "type": "logs",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 10
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "showCommonLabels": false,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "prettifyLogMessage": false,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{container=\"webmon-monitor\"} |= \"WebMon recovery:\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": [
    "webmon",
    "logs"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "title": "WebMon - Logs",
  "uid": "webmon-logs",
  "version": 2,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "10s",
  "description": "Logs Docker par conteneur, recherche et actions de récupération WebMon.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "container",
        "label": "Conteneur",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "loki",
          "uid": "loki"
        },
        "query": "label_values({container=~\".+\"}, container)",
        "definition": "label_values({container=~\".+\"}, container)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": []
      },
      {
        "name": "stream",
        "label": "Flux",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "stdout,stderr",
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "stdout",
            "value": "stdout",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "stderr",
            "value": "stderr",
            "selected": false
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "search",
        "label": "Texte (sensible à la casse)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "",
            "value": "",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
